; Which rows vanish when a sum is zero.
P 2026-01-01 X 2 EUR
P 2026-01-01 Z 0 EUR

2026-01-01 units cancel in one commodity of two
    zeromix       5 X
    zeromix      -5 X
    zeromix       3 Y
    sink0

2026-01-02 cost cancels a plain EUR amount
    costzero     10 X @ 2 EUR
    costzero    -20 EUR
    sink1

2026-01-03 cost leaves 5 EUR
    costhalf     10 X @ 2 EUR
    costhalf    -20 EUR
    costhalf      5 EUR
    sink2

2026-01-04 value cancels another value
    valcancel     3 EUR
    valcancel    -1.5 X
    sink3

2026-01-05 price of zero
    zeroprice     5 Z
    sink4

2026-01-06 units cancel exactly
    unitzero      4 Y
    unitzero     -4 Y
    sink5

2026-01-07 two costs for the same units
    twocosts     10 X @ 2 EUR
    twocosts    -10 X @ 3 EUR
    sink6
